{"total": 345.106, "segs": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 1.564, "text": "You are holding a piece of paper.", "words": [{"text": "You", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.14}, {"text": "are", "start": 0.14, "end": 0.24}, {"text": "holding", "start": 0.24, "end": 0.54}, {"text": "a", "start": 0.54, "end": 0.74}, {"text": "piece", "start": 0.74, "end": 0.92}, {"text": "of", "start": 0.92, "end": 1.1}, {"text": "paper.", "start": 1.1, "end": 1.36}]}, {"start": 2.014, "end": 4.811, "text": "Say it's worth four hundred million dollars.", "words": [{"text": "Say", "start": 2.014, "end": 2.334}, {"text": "it's", "start": 2.334, "end": 2.574}, {"text": "worth", "start": 2.574, "end": 2.814}, {"text": "four", "start": 2.814, "end": 3.414}, {"text": "hundred", "start": 3.414, "end": 3.814}, {"text": "million", "start": 3.814, "end": 4.214}, {"text": "dollars.", "start": 4.214, "end": 4.634}]}, {"start": 5.261, "end": 11.445, "text": "You checked the numbers three times. You checked them again in the bathroom, with the door locked.", "words": [{"text": "You", "start": 5.261, "end": 5.381}, {"text": "checked", "start": 5.381, "end": 5.641}, {"text": "the", "start": 5.641, "end": 5.861}, {"text": "numbers", "start": 5.861, "end": 6.261}, {"text": "three", "start": 6.261, "end": 6.661}, {"text": "times.", "start": 6.661, "end": 7.281}, {"text": "You", "start": 7.861, "end": 8.241}, {"text": "checked", "start": 8.241, "end": 8.501}, {"text": "them", "start": 8.501, "end": 8.661}, {"text": "again", "start": 8.661, "end": 8.961}, {"text": "in", "start": 8.961, "end": 9.301}, {"text": "the", "start": 9.301, "end": 9.401}, {"text": "bathroom,", "start": 9.401, "end": 9.781}, {"text": "with", "start": 10.081, "end": 10.221}, {"text": "the", "start": 10.221, "end": 10.341}, {"text": "door", "start": 10.341, "end": 10.681}, {"text": "locked.", "start": 10.681, "end": 11.121}]}, {"start": 11.895, "end": 18.128, "text": "The odds of this, by most accounts, are about one in three hundred million.", "words": [{"text": "The", "start": 11.895, "end": 12.115}, {"text": "odds", "start": 12.115, "end": 12.415}, {"text": "of", "start": 12.415, "end": 12.595}, {"text": "this,", "start": 12.595, "end": 12.895}, {"text": "by", "start": 13.155, "end": 13.375}, {"text": "most", "start": 13.375, "end": 13.755}, {"text": "accounts,", "start": 13.755, "end": 14.135}, {"text": "are", "start": 14.615, "end": 14.715}, {"text": "about", "start": 14.715, "end": 14.955}, {"text": "one", "start": 14.955, "end": 15.415}, {"text": "in", "start": 15.415, "end": 15.875}, {"text": "three", "start": 15.875, "end": 16.335}, {"text": "hundred", "start": 16.335, "end": 17.035}, {"text": "million.", "start": 17.035, "end": 17.815}]}, {"start": 18.578, "end": 22.373, "text": "So congratulations. You have just beaten the universe.", "words": [{"text": "So", "start": 18.578, "end": 18.758}, {"text": "congratulations.", "start": 18.758, "end": 19.298}, {"text": "You", "start": 20.098, "end": 20.358}, {"text": "have", "start": 20.358, "end": 20.498}, {"text": "just", "start": 20.498, "end": 20.738}, {"text": "beaten", "start": 20.738, "end": 21.158}, {"text": "the", "start": 21.158, "end": 21.658}, {"text": "universe.", "start": 21.658, "end": 21.978}]}, {"start": 22.823, "end": 27.306, "text": "Now comes the hard part. Because the paper is the easy part.", "words": [{"text": "Now", "start": 22.823, "end": 23.043}, {"text": "comes", "start": 23.043, "end": 23.363}, {"text": "the", "start": 23.363, "end": 23.563}, {"text": "hard", "start": 23.563, "end": 23.863}, {"text": "part.", "start": 23.863, "end": 24.223}, {"text": "Because", "start": 25.003, "end": 25.383}, {"text": "the", "start": 25.383, "end": 25.583}, {"text": "paper", "start": 25.583, "end": 25.863}, {"text": "is", "start": 25.863, "end": 26.323}, {"text": "the", "start": 26.323, "end": 26.483}, {"text": "easy", "start": 26.483, "end": 26.783}, {"text": "part.", "start": 26.783, "end": 27.103}]}, {"start": 27.756, "end": 33.671, "text": "The first rule of your new life is simple. Do not lose the ticket.", "words": [{"text": "The", "start": 27.756, "end": 27.876}, {"text": "first", "start": 27.876, "end": 28.156}, {"text": "rule", "start": 28.156, "end": 28.516}, {"text": "of", "start": 28.516, "end": 28.696}, {"text": "your", "start": 28.696, "end": 28.836}, {"text": "new", "start": 28.836, "end": 29.076}, {"text": "life", "start": 29.076, "end": 29.496}, {"text": "is", "start": 29.496, "end": 29.836}, {"text": "simple.", "start": 29.836, "end": 30.256}, {"text": "Do", "start": 30.916, "end": 31.276}, {"text": "not", "start": 31.276, "end": 31.616}, {"text": "lose", "start": 31.616, "end": 32.416}, {"text": "the", "start": 32.416, "end": 33.016}, {"text": "ticket.", "start": 33.016, "end": 33.376}]}, {"start": 34.121, "end": 43.774, "text": "You put it in a book. Then you worry about the book. So you move it to the freezer. Then you remember freezers have fires.", "words": [{"text": "You", "start": 34.121, "end": 34.361}, {"text": "put", "start": 34.361, "end": 34.601}, {"text": "it", "start": 34.601, "end": 34.761}, {"text": "in", "start": 34.761, "end": 34.961}, {"text": "a", "start": 34.961, "end": 35.061}, {"text": "book.", "start": 35.061, "end": 35.421}, {"text": "Then", "start": 36.041, "end": 36.581}, {"text": "you", "start": 36.581, "end": 36.741}, {"text": "worry", "start": 36.741, "end": 36.981}, {"text": "about", "start": 36.981, "end": 37.241}, {"text": "the", "start": 37.241, "end": 37.441}, {"text": "book.", "start": 37.441, "end": 37.741}, {"text": "So", "start": 38.481, "end": 38.841}, {"text": "you", "start": 38.841, "end": 39.121}, {"text": "move", "start": 39.121, "end": 39.301}, {"text": "it", "start": 39.301, "end": 39.461}, {"text": "to", "start": 39.461, "end": 39.561}, {"text": "the", "start": 39.561, "end": 39.661}, {"text": "freezer.", "start": 39.661, "end": 40.001}, {"text": "Then", "start": 40.801, "end": 41.101}, {"text": "you", "start": 41.101, "end": 41.281}, {"text": "remember", "start": 41.281, "end": 41.681}, {"text": "freezers", "start": 41.681, "end": 42.701}, {"text": "have", "start": 42.701, "end": 43.001}, {"text": "fires.", "start": 43.001, "end": 43.441}]}, {"start": 44.224, "end": 49.958, "text": "You sign the back, in your best handwriting, with a pen that you test twice.", "words": [{"text": "You", "start": 44.224, "end": 44.344}, {"text": "sign", "start": 44.344, "end": 44.604}, {"text": "the", "start": 44.604, "end": 44.764}, {"text": "back,", "start": 44.764, "end": 45.104}, {"text": "in", "start": 45.484, "end": 45.604}, {"text": "your", "start": 45.604, "end": 45.724}, {"text": "best", "start": 45.724, "end": 46.044}, {"text": "handwriting,", "start": 46.044, "end": 46.604}, {"text": "with", "start": 47.424, "end": 47.744}, {"text": "a", "start": 47.744, "end": 47.864}, {"text": "pen", "start": 47.864, "end": 48.184}, {"text": "that", "start": 48.184, "end": 48.604}, {"text": "you", "start": 48.604, "end": 48.744}, {"text": "test", "start": 48.744, "end": 49.204}, {"text": "twice.", "start": 49.204, "end": 49.624}]}, {"start": 50.408, "end": 55.339, "text": "You have not told anyone. Your face has told everyone.", "words": [{"text": "You", "start": 50.408, "end": 50.548}, {"text": "have", "start": 50.548, "end": 50.688}, {"text": "not", "start": 50.688, "end": 50.908}, {"text": "told", "start": 50.908, "end": 51.328}, {"text": "anyone.", "start": 51.328, "end": 51.968}, {"text": "Your", "start": 52.908, "end": 53.028}, {"text": "face", "start": 53.028, "end": 53.448}, {"text": "has", "start": 53.448, "end": 54.168}, {"text": "told", "start": 54.168, "end": 54.508}, {"text": "everyone.", "start": 54.508, "end": 55.068}]}, {"start": 55.789, "end": 60.267, "text": "Your dog looks at you strangely. Even he knows something is different.", "words": [{"text": "Your", "start": 55.789, "end": 55.909}, {"text": "dog", "start": 55.909, "end": 56.169}, {"text": "looks", "start": 56.169, "end": 56.509}, {"text": "at", "start": 56.509, "end": 56.709}, {"text": "you", "start": 56.709, "end": 56.829}, {"text": "strangely.", "start": 56.829, "end": 57.309}, {"text": "Even", "start": 57.949, "end": 58.229}, {"text": "he", "start": 58.229, "end": 58.609}, {"text": "knows", "start": 58.609, "end": 59.089}, {"text": "something", "start": 59.089, "end": 59.509}, {"text": "is", "start": 59.509, "end": 59.789}, {"text": "different.", "start": 59.789, "end": 60.109}]}, {"start": 60.717, "end": 66.413, "text": "And you still have to go to work tomorrow, because you can't quit a job with a piece of paper.", "words": [{"text": "And", "start": 60.717, "end": 60.877}, {"text": "you", "start": 60.877, "end": 61.097}, {"text": "still", "start": 61.097, "end": 61.417}, {"text": "have", "start": 61.417, "end": 61.677}, {"text": "to", "start": 61.677, "end": 61.817}, {"text": "go", "start": 61.817, "end": 61.937}, {"text": "to", "start": 61.937, "end": 62.077}, {"text": "work", "start": 62.077, "end": 62.377}, {"text": "tomorrow,", "start": 62.377, "end": 62.917}, {"text": "because", "start": 63.337, "end": 63.937}, {"text": "you", "start": 63.937, "end": 64.117}, {"text": "can't", "start": 64.117, "end": 64.417}, {"text": "quit", "start": 64.417, "end": 64.617}, {"text": "a", "start": 64.617, "end": 64.777}, {"text": "job", "start": 64.777, "end": 65.157}, {"text": "with", "start": 65.157, "end": 65.437}, {"text": "a", "start": 65.437, "end": 65.537}, {"text": "piece", "start": 65.537, "end": 65.757}, {"text": "of", "start": 65.757, "end": 65.917}, {"text": "paper.", "start": 65.917, "end": 66.197}]}, {"start": 66.863, "end": 68.703, "text": "Next, the lottery office.", "words": [{"text": "Next,", "start": 66.863, "end": 67.243}, {"text": "the", "start": 67.703, "end": 67.783}, {"text": "lottery", "start": 67.783, "end": 68.143}, {"text": "office.", "start": 68.143, "end": 68.483}]}, {"start": 69.153, "end": 82.247, "text": "They tell you the headline number isn't what you get. If you take the lump sum, it's roughly half of the advertised jackpot. Then taxes take a big bite out of that.", "words": [{"text": "They", "start": 69.153, "end": 69.273}, {"text": "tell", "start": 69.273, "end": 69.533}, {"text": "you", "start": 69.533, "end": 69.673}, {"text": "the", "start": 69.673, "end": 69.813}, {"text": "headline", "start": 69.813, "end": 70.133}, {"text": "number", "start": 70.133, "end": 70.673}, {"text": "isn't", "start": 70.673, "end": 71.413}, {"text": "what", "start": 71.413, "end": 71.593}, {"text": "you", "start": 71.593, "end": 71.793}, {"text": "get.", "start": 71.793, "end": 72.073}, {"text": "If", "start": 73.193, "end": 73.373}, {"text": "you", "start": 73.373, "end": 73.493}, {"text": "take", "start": 73.493, "end": 73.693}, {"text": "the", "start": 73.693, "end": 73.853}, {"text": "lump", "start": 73.853, "end": 74.093}, {"text": "sum,", "start": 74.093, "end": 74.533}, {"text": "it's", "start": 75.153, "end": 75.493}, {"text": "roughly", "start": 75.493, "end": 75.773}, {"text": "half", "start": 75.773, "end": 76.313}, {"text": "of", "start": 76.313, "end": 76.793}, {"text": "the", "start": 76.793, "end": 76.893}, {"text": "advertised", "start": 76.893, "end": 77.313}, {"text": "jackpot.", "start": 77.313, "end": 77.993}, {"text": "Then", "start": 78.633, "end": 79.133}, {"text": "taxes", "start": 79.133, "end": 79.833}, {"text": "take", "start": 79.833, "end": 80.433}, {"text": "a", "start": 80.433, "end": 80.573}, {"text": "big", "start": 80.573, "end": 80.933}, {"text": "bite", "start": 80.933, "end": 81.353}, {"text": "out", "start": 81.353, "end": 81.713}, {"text": "of", "start": 81.713, "end": 81.873}, {"text": "that.", "start": 81.873, "end": 82.073}]}, {"start": 82.697, "end": 85.685, "text": "Say you walk out with a bit over a hundred million.", "words": [{"text": "Say", "start": 82.697, "end": 82.937}, {"text": "you", "start": 82.937, "end": 83.117}, {"text": "walk", "start": 83.117, "end": 83.317}, {"text": "out", "start": 83.317, "end": 83.557}, {"text": "with", "start": 83.557, "end": 83.777}, {"text": "a", "start": 83.777, "end": 83.937}, {"text": "bit", "start": 83.937, "end": 84.077}, {"text": "over", "start": 84.077, "end": 84.477}, {"text": "a", "start": 84.477, "end": 84.857}, {"text": "hundred", "start": 84.857, "end": 85.177}, {"text": "million.", "start": 85.177, "end": 85.517}]}, {"start": 86.135, "end": 91.325, "text": "You stand on the sidewalk, unsure whether to cry or do the math again.", "words": [{"text": "You", "start": 86.135, "end": 86.255}, {"text": "stand", "start": 86.255, "end": 86.535}, {"text": "on", "start": 86.535, "end": 86.735}, {"text": "the", "start": 86.735, "end": 86.855}, {"text": "sidewalk,", "start": 86.855, "end": 87.335}, {"text": "unsure", "start": 87.915, "end": 88.495}, {"text": "whether", "start": 88.495, "end": 88.835}, {"text": "to", "start": 88.835, "end": 89.035}, {"text": "cry", "start": 89.035, "end": 89.455}, {"text": "or", "start": 89.455, "end": 90.255}, {"text": "do", "start": 90.255, "end": 90.475}, {"text": "the", "start": 90.475, "end": 90.615}, {"text": "math", "start": 90.615, "end": 90.935}, {"text": "again.", "start": 90.935, "end": 91.195}]}, {"start": 91.775, "end": 98.76, "text": "Then you remember that in some places, winners can't stay anonymous. Your name will be public.", "words": [{"text": "Then", "start": 91.775, "end": 92.015}, {"text": "you", "start": 92.015, "end": 92.175}, {"text": "remember", "start": 92.175, "end": 92.555}, {"text": "that", "start": 92.555, "end": 92.975}, {"text": "in", "start": 92.975, "end": 93.095}, {"text": "some", "start": 93.095, "end": 93.355}, {"text": "places,", "start": 93.355, "end": 93.835}, {"text": "winners", "start": 94.335, "end": 94.715}, {"text": "can't", "start": 94.715, "end": 95.435}, {"text": "stay", "start": 95.435, "end": 95.655}, {"text": "anonymous.", "start": 95.655, "end": 96.075}, {"text": "Your", "start": 97.115, "end": 97.275}, {"text": "name", "start": 97.275, "end": 97.655}, {"text": "will", "start": 97.655, "end": 98.035}, {"text": "be", "start": 98.035, "end": 98.215}, {"text": "public.", "start": 98.215, "end": 98.555}]}, {"start": 99.21, "end": 102.075, "text": "Which is the moment the phone starts to ring.", "words": [{"text": "Which", "start": 99.21, "end": 99.43}, {"text": "is", "start": 99.43, "end": 99.73}, {"text": "the", "start": 99.73, "end": 99.89}, {"text": "moment", "start": 99.89, "end": 100.27}, {"text": "the", "start": 100.27, "end": 100.73}, {"text": "phone", "start": 100.73, "end": 101.07}, {"text": "starts", "start": 101.07, "end": 101.41}, {"text": "to", "start": 101.41, "end": 101.71}, {"text": "ring.", "start": 101.71, "end": 101.91}]}, {"start": 102.525, "end": 106.517, "text": "It's your cousin. The one you haven't spoken to in nine years.", "words": [{"text": "It's", "start": 102.525, "end": 102.725}, {"text": "your", "start": 102.725, "end": 102.805}, {"text": "cousin.", "start": 102.805, "end": 103.105}, {"text": "The", "start": 104.005, "end": 104.205}, {"text": "one", "start": 104.205, "end": 104.325}, {"text": "you", "start": 104.325, "end": 104.425}, {"text": "haven't", "start": 104.425, "end": 104.705}, {"text": "spoken", "start": 104.705, "end": 104.965}, {"text": "to", "start": 104.965, "end": 105.265}, {"text": "in", "start": 105.265, "end": 105.445}, {"text": "nine", "start": 105.445, "end": 105.785}, {"text": "years.", "start": 105.785, "end": 106.345}]}, {"start": 106.967, "end": 112.527, "text": "He has a business idea. A food truck. Shaped like a boat.", "words": [{"text": "He", "start": 106.967, "end": 107.107}, {"text": "has", "start": 107.107, "end": 107.327}, {"text": "a", "start": 107.327, "end": 107.427}, {"text": "business", "start": 107.427, "end": 107.727}, {"text": "idea.", "start": 107.727, "end": 108.307}, {"text": "A", "start": 109.247, "end": 109.327}, {"text": "food", "start": 109.327, "end": 109.667}, {"text": "truck.", "start": 109.667, "end": 110.087}, {"text": "Shaped", "start": 110.867, "end": 111.467}, {"text": "like", "start": 111.467, "end": 111.807}, {"text": "a", "start": 111.807, "end": 111.947}, {"text": "boat.", "start": 111.947, "end": 112.247}]}, {"start": 112.977, "end": 119.718, "text": "Then it's a friend from school. Then someone who says they went to school with you, and you've never seen them in your life.", "words": [{"text": "Then", "start": 112.977, "end": 113.217}, {"text": "it's", "start": 113.217, "end": 113.497}, {"text": "a", "start": 113.497, "end": 113.557}, {"text": "friend", "start": 113.557, "end": 113.817}, {"text": "from", "start": 113.817, "end": 114.017}, {"text": "school.", "start": 114.017, "end": 114.457}, {"text": "Then", "start": 115.257, "end": 115.497}, {"text": "someone", "start": 115.497, "end": 115.777}, {"text": "who", "start": 115.777, "end": 115.957}, {"text": "says", "start": 115.957, "end": 116.197}, {"text": "they", "start": 116.197, "end": 116.517}, {"text": "went", "start": 116.517, "end": 116.697}, {"text": "to", "start": 116.697, "end": 116.877}, {"text": "school", "start": 116.877, "end": 117.177}, {"text": "with", "start": 117.177, "end": 117.457}, {"text": "you,", "start": 117.457, "end": 117.757}, {"text": "and", "start": 117.997, "end": 118.197}, {"text": "you've", "start": 118.197, "end": 118.437}, {"text": "never", "start": 118.437, "end": 118.637}, {"text": "seen", "start": 118.637, "end": 118.897}, {"text": "them", "start": 118.897, "end": 119.037}, {"text": "in", "start": 119.037, "end": 119.157}, {"text": "your", "start": 119.157, "end": 119.297}, {"text": "life.", "start": 119.297, "end": 119.557}]}, {"start": 120.168, "end": 125.492, "text": "By the end of the week, you have a hundred and forty voicemails, and eleven of them are crying.", "words": [{"text": "By", "start": 120.168, "end": 120.288}, {"text": "the", "start": 120.288, "end": 120.388}, {"text": "end", "start": 120.388, "end": 120.528}, {"text": "of", "start": 120.528, "end": 120.648}, {"text": "the", "start": 120.648, "end": 120.708}, {"text": "week,", "start": 120.708, "end": 120.968}, {"text": "you", "start": 121.248, "end": 121.368}, {"text": "have", "start": 121.368, "end": 121.508}, {"text": "a", "start": 121.508, "end": 121.628}, {"text": "hundred", "start": 121.628, "end": 121.908}, {"text": "and", "start": 121.908, "end": 122.088}, {"text": "forty", "start": 122.088, "end": 122.448}, {"text": "voicemails,", "start": 122.448, "end": 123.348}, {"text": "and", "start": 123.688, "end": 123.868}, {"text": "eleven", "start": 123.868, "end": 124.168}, {"text": "of", "start": 124.168, "end": 124.428}, {"text": "them", "start": 124.428, "end": 124.628}, {"text": "are", "start": 124.628, "end": 124.888}, {"text": "crying.", "start": 124.888, "end": 125.248}]}, {"start": 125.942, "end": 129.782, "text": "You say yes to the first one, because you feel guilty.", "words": [{"text": "You", "start": 125.942, "end": 126.222}, {"text": "say", "start": 126.222, "end": 126.462}, {"text": "yes", "start": 126.462, "end": 126.802}, {"text": "to", "start": 126.802, "end": 127.142}, {"text": "the", "start": 127.142, "end": 127.242}, {"text": "first", "start": 127.242, "end": 127.522}, {"text": "one,", "start": 127.522, "end": 127.822}, {"text": "because", "start": 128.122, "end": 128.602}, {"text": "you", "start": 128.602, "end": 128.902}, {"text": "feel", "start": 128.902, "end": 129.162}, {"text": "guilty.", "start": 129.162, "end": 129.502}]}, {"start": 130.232, "end": 133.783, "text": "You say no to the next ten, because you feel guilty.", "words": [{"text": "You", "start": 130.232, "end": 130.372}, {"text": "say", "start": 130.372, "end": 130.572}, {"text": "no", "start": 130.572, "end": 130.872}, {"text": "to", "start": 130.872, "end": 131.132}, {"text": "the", "start": 131.132, "end": 131.232}, {"text": "next", "start": 131.232, "end": 131.432}, {"text": "ten,", "start": 131.432, "end": 131.872}, {"text": "because", "start": 132.352, "end": 132.812}, {"text": "you", "start": 132.812, "end": 133.012}, {"text": "feel", "start": 133.012, "end": 133.272}, {"text": "guilty.", "start": 133.272, "end": 133.552}]}, {"start": 134.233, "end": 141.326, "text": "You are rich, and somehow, you have never felt so poor in friends.", "words": [{"text": "You", "start": 134.233, "end": 134.553}, {"text": "are", "start": 134.553, "end": 134.913}, {"text": "rich,", "start": 134.913, "end": 135.413}, {"text": "and", "start": 136.413, "end": 136.713}, {"text": "somehow,", "start": 136.713, "end": 137.273}, {"text": "you", "start": 137.713, "end": 137.973}, {"text": "have", "start": 137.973, "end": 138.153}, {"text": "never", "start": 138.153, "end": 138.593}, {"text": "felt", "start": 138.593, "end": 139.013}, {"text": "so", "start": 139.013, "end": 139.433}, {"text": "poor", "start": 139.433, "end": 139.993}, {"text": "in", "start": 139.993, "end": 140.573}, {"text": "friends.", "start": 140.573, "end": 140.993}]}, {"start": 141.776, "end": 144.435, "text": "Okay. Time to have a little fun.", "words": [{"text": "Okay.", "start": 141.776, "end": 142.056}, {"text": "Time", "start": 142.336, "end": 142.776}, {"text": "to", "start": 142.776, "end": 143.016}, {"text": "have", "start": 143.016, "end": 143.276}, {"text": "a", "start": 143.276, "end": 143.556}, {"text": "little", "start": 143.556, "end": 143.856}, {"text": "fun.", "start": 143.856, "end": 144.196}]}, {"start": 144.885, "end": 151.353, "text": "You buy a house. A bigger house. A house with a room that's just for coats.", "words": [{"text": "You", "start": 144.885, "end": 145.005}, {"text": "buy", "start": 145.005, "end": 145.245}, {"text": "a", "start": 145.245, "end": 145.385}, {"text": "house.", "start": 145.385, "end": 145.805}, {"text": "A", "start": 146.625, "end": 146.825}, {"text": "bigger", "start": 146.825, "end": 147.065}, {"text": "house.", "start": 147.065, "end": 147.525}, {"text": "A", "start": 148.445, "end": 148.605}, {"text": "house", "start": 148.605, "end": 148.905}, {"text": "with", "start": 