ext": "year", "start": 218.678, "end": 219.098}, {"text": "three.", "start": 219.098, "end": 219.698}, {"text": "You", "start": 220.718, "end": 220.898}, {"text": "own", "start": 220.898, "end": 221.278}, {"text": "four", "start": 221.278, "end": 221.818}, {"text": "houses.", "start": 221.818, "end": 222.318}, {"text": "You", "start": 223.238, "end": 223.418}, {"text": "are", "start": 223.418, "end": 223.498}, {"text": "paying", "start": 223.498, "end": 223.758}, {"text": "for", "start": 223.758, "end": 224.018}, {"text": "two", "start": 224.018, "end": 224.338}, {"text": "of", "start": 224.338, "end": 224.478}, {"text": "them", "start": 224.478, "end": 224.758}, {"text": "in", "start": 224.758, "end": 225.158}, {"text": "ways", "start": 225.158, "end": 225.418}, {"text": "you", "start": 225.418, "end": 225.698}, {"text": "don't", "start": 225.698, "end": 226.178}, {"text": "fully", "start": 226.178, "end": 226.578}, {"text": "understand.", "start": 226.578, "end": 227.278}]}, {"start": 228.071, "end": 232.631, "text": "Someone you trusted has been taking a very generous fee.", "words": [{"text": "Someone", "start": 228.071, "end": 228.391}, {"text": "you", "start": 228.391, "end": 228.671}, {"text": "trusted", "start": 228.671, "end": 229.131}, {"text": "has", "start": 229.131, "end": 229.531}, {"text": "been", "start": 229.531, "end": 229.711}, {"text": "taking", "start": 229.711, "end": 230.071}, {"text": "a", "start": 230.071, "end": 230.451}, {"text": "very", "start": 230.451, "end": 230.931}, {"text": "generous", "start": 230.931, "end": 231.691}, {"text": "fee.", "start": 231.691, "end": 232.391}]}, {"start": 233.081, "end": 238.149, "text": "And your cousin's boat-shaped food truck has sunk. Twice.", "words": [{"text": "And", "start": 233.081, "end": 233.481}, {"text": "your", "start": 233.481, "end": 233.721}, {"text": "cousin's", "start": 233.721, "end": 234.341}, {"text": "boat-shaped", "start": 234.341, "end": 234.901}, {"text": "food", "start": 234.901, "end": 235.321}, {"text": "truck", "start": 235.321, "end": 235.721}, {"text": "has", "start": 235.721, "end": 235.921}, {"text": "sunk.", "start": 235.921, "end": 236.301}, {"text": "Twice.", "start": 237.201, "end": 237.741}]}, {"start": 238.599, "end": 241.43, "text": "So you do something unusual.", "words": [{"text": "So", "start": 238.599, "end": 238.819}, {"text": "you", "start": 238.819, "end": 238.999}, {"text": "do", "start": 238.999, "end": 239.239}, {"text": "something", "start": 239.239, "end": 239.739}, {"text": "unusual.", "start": 239.739, "end": 240.679}]}, {"start": 241.88, "end": 248.332, "text": "You sit down at the kitchen table, with a real financial planner, and you ask the only question that matters.", "words": [{"text": "You", "start": 241.88, "end": 241.98}, {"text": "sit", "start": 241.98, "end": 242.16}, {"text": "down", "start": 242.16, "end": 242.44}, {"text": "at", "start": 242.44, "end": 242.56}, {"text": "the", "start": 242.56, "end": 242.66}, {"text": "kitchen", "start": 242.66, "end": 242.86}, {"text": "table,", "start": 242.86, "end": 243.32}, {"text": "with", "start": 243.72, "end": 243.88}, {"text": "a", "start": 243.88, "end": 244.0}, {"text": "real", "start": 244.0, "end": 244.36}, {"text": "financial", "start": 244.36, "end": 244.9}, {"text": "planner,", "start": 244.9, "end": 245.3}, {"text": "and", "start": 245.76, "end": 246.0}, {"text": "you", "start": 246.0, "end": 246.12}, {"text": "ask", "start": 246.12, "end": 246.5}, {"text": "the", "start": 246.5, "end": 246.74}, {"text": "only", "start": 246.74, "end": 247.14}, {"text": "question", "start": 247.14, "end": 247.56}, {"text": "that", "start": 247.56, "end": 247.86}, {"text": "matters.", "start": 247.86, "end": 248.16}]}, {"start": 248.782, "end": 251.765, "text": "What would happen if I did nothing?", "words": [{"text": "What", "start": 248.782, "end": 249.022}, {"text": "would", "start": 249.022, "end": 249.242}, {"text": "happen", "start": 249.242, "end": 249.782}, {"text": "if", "start": 249.782, "end": 250.462}, {"text": "I", "start": 250.462, "end": 250.682}, {"text": "did", "start": 250.682, "end": 251.022}, {"text": "nothing?", "start": 251.022, "end": 251.442}]}, {"start": 252.215, "end": 258.214, "text": "The planner nods slowly. The way people nod when they've been waiting years for someone to ask.", "words": [{"text": "The", "start": 252.215, "end": 252.315}, {"text": "planner", "start": 252.315, "end": 252.595}, {"text": "nods", "start": 252.595, "end": 253.255}, {"text": "slowly.", "start": 253.255, "end": 253.595}, {"text": "The", "start": 254.375, "end": 254.455}, {"text": "way", "start": 254.455, "end": 254.615}, {"text": "people", "start": 254.615, "end": 254.935}, {"text": "nod", "start": 254.935, "end": 255.335}, {"text": "when", "start": 255.335, "end": 255.735}, {"text": "they've", "start": 255.735, "end": 255.935}, {"text": "been", "start": 255.935, "end": 256.055}, {"text": "waiting", "start": 256.055, "end": 256.315}, {"text": "years", "start": 256.315, "end": 256.935}, {"text": "for", "start": 256.935, "end": 257.275}, {"text": "someone", "start": 257.275, "end": 257.535}, {"text": "to", "start": 257.535, "end": 257.775}, {"text": "ask.", "start": 257.775, "end": 258.115}]}, {"start": 258.664, "end": 266.106, "text": "You sell two of the houses. You say sorry to a few people. You stop saying yes to everyone.", "words": [{"text": "You", "start": 258.664, "end": 258.784}, {"text": "sell", "start": 258.784, "end": 259.124}, {"text": "two", "start": 259.124, "end": 259.424}, {"text": "of", "start": 259.424, "end": 259.584}, {"text": "the", "start": 259.584, "end": 259.704}, {"text": "houses.", "start": 259.704, "end": 259.984}, {"text": "You", "start": 260.824, "end": 260.984}, {"text": "say", "start": 260.984, "end": 261.184}, {"text": "sorry", "start": 261.184, "end": 261.624}, {"text": "to", "start": 261.624, "end": 262.004}, {"text": "a", "start": 262.004, "end": 262.144}, {"text": "few", "start": 262.144, "end": 262.264}, {"text": "people.", "start": 262.264, "end": 262.584}, {"text": "You", "start": 263.464, "end": 263.764}, {"text": "stop", "start": 263.764, "end": 264.144}, {"text": "saying", "start": 264.144, "end": 264.744}, {"text": "yes", "start": 264.744, "end": 265.144}, {"text": "to", "start": 265.144, "end": 265.644}, {"text": "everyone.", "start": 265.644, "end": 265.884}]}, {"start": 266.556, "end": 273.15, "text": "You put the rest into boring things. The kind of boring that doesn't come with a food truck.", "words": [{"text": "You", "start": 266.556, "end": 266.676}, {"text": "put", "start": 266.676, "end": 266.856}, {"text": "the", "start": 266.856, "end": 267.036}, {"text": "rest", "start": 267.036, "end": 267.496}, {"text": "into", "start": 267.496, "end": 267.896}, {"text": "boring", "start": 267.896, "end": 268.416}, {"text": "things.", "start": 268.416, "end": 268.956}, {"text": "The", "start": 269.856, "end": 270.136}, {"text": "kind", "start": 270.136, "end": 270.376}, {"text": "of", "start": 270.376, "end": 270.496}, {"text": "boring", "start": 270.496, "end": 270.936}, {"text": "that", "start": 270.936, "end": 271.396}, {"text": "doesn't", "start": 271.396, "end": 271.976}, {"text": "come", "start": 271.976, "end": 272.196}, {"text": "with", "start": 272.196, "end": 272.356}, {"text": "a", "start": 272.356, "end": 272.456}, {"text": "food", "start": 272.456, "end": 272.716}, {"text": "truck.", "start": 272.716, "end": 273.016}]}, {"start": 273.6, "end": 282.764, "text": "It feels like losing. It feels like losing, and it's the best decision you've made since you signed the back of the ticket.", "words": [{"text": "It", "start": 273.6, "end": 273.74}, {"text": "feels", "start": 273.74, "end": 274.0}, {"text": "like", "start": 274.0, "end": 274.28}, {"text": "losing.", "start": 274.28, "end": 274.66}, {"text": "It", "start": 275.52, "end": 276.14}, {"text": "feels", "start": 276.14, "end": 276.4}, {"text": "like", "start": 276.4, "end": 276.76}, {"text": "losing,", "start": 276.76, "end": 277.34}, {"text": "and", "start": 277.72, "end": 278.7}, {"text": "it's", "start": 278.7, "end": 278.88}, {"text": "the", "start": 278.88, "end": 279.0}, {"text": "best", "start": 279.0, "end": 279.34}, {"text": "decision", "start": 279.34, "end": 279.78}, {"text": "you've", "start": 279.78, "end": 280.12}, {"text": "made", "start": 280.12, "end": 280.46}, {"text": "since", "start": 280.46, "end": 280.98}, {"text": "you", "start": 280.98, "end": 281.18}, {"text": "signed", "start": 281.18, "end": 281.5}, {"text": "the", "start": 281.5, "end": 281.68}, {"text": "back", "start": 281.68, "end": 281.92}, {"text": "of", "start": 281.92, "end": 282.04}, {"text": "the", "start": 282.04, "end": 282.16}, {"text": "ticket.", "start": 282.16, "end": 282.44}]}, {"start": 283.214, "end": 287.134, "text": "Ten years later, you wake up on an ordinary Tuesday.", "words": [{"text": "Ten", "start": 283.214, "end": 283.414}, {"text": "years", "start": 283.414, "end": 283.694}, {"text": "later,", "start": 283.694, "end": 284.094}, {"text": "you", "start": 284.514, "end": 284.874}, {"text": "wake", "start": 284.874, "end": 285.074}, {"text": "up", "start": 285.074, "end": 285.394}, {"text": "on", "start": 285.394, "end": 285.754}, {"text": "an", "start": 285.754, "end": 285.874}, {"text": "ordinary", "start": 285.874, "end": 286.394}, {"text": "Tuesday.", "start": 286.394, "end": 286.774}]}, {"start": 287.584, "end": 294.533, "text": "You live in one house. You drive one car, an old one that you refuse to replace.", "words": [{"text": "You", "start": 287.584, "end": 287.744}, {"text": "live", "start": 287.744, "end": 287.984}, {"text": "in", "start": 287.984, "end": 288.444}, {"text": "one", "start": 288.444, "end": 288.744}, {"text": "house.", "start": 288.744, "end": 289.284}, {"text": "You", "start": 290.004, "end": 290.124}, {"text": "drive", "start": 290.124, "end": 290.464}, {"text": "one", "start": 290.464, "end": 290.884}, {"text": "car,", "start": 290.884, "end": 291.304}, {"text": "an", "start": 292.024, "end": 292.184}, {"text": "old", "start": 292.184, "end": 292.484}, {"text": "one", "start": 292.484, "end": 292.744}, {"text": "that", "start": 292.744, "end": 293.064}, {"text": "you", "start": 293.064, "end": 293.204}, {"text": "refuse", "start": 293.204, "end": 293.564}, {"text": "to", "start": 293.564, "end": 293.884}, {"text": "replace.", "start": 293.884, "end": 294.244}]}, {"start": 294.983, "end": 302.807, "text": "Your life is almost completely normal. The only thing that changed is that you stopped worrying about Tuesday.", "words": [{"text": "Your", "start": 294.983, "end": 295.163}, {"text": "life", "start": 295.163, "end": 295.503}, {"text": "is", "start": 295.503, "end": 295.763}, {"text": "almost", "start": 295.763, "end": 296.203}, {"text": "completely", "start": 296.203, "end": 296.923}, {"text": "normal.", "start": 296.923, "end": 297.423}, {"text": "The", "start": 298.543, "end": 298.703}, {"text": "only", "start": 298.703, "end": 298.903}, {"text": "thing", "start": 298.903, "end": 299.103}, {"text": "that", "start": 299.103, "end": 299.243}, {"text": "changed", "start": 299.243, "end": 299.743}, {"text": "is", "start": 299.743, "end": 300.223}, {"text": "that", "start": 300.223, "end": 300.403}, {"text": "you", "start": 300.403, "end": 300.523}, {"text": "stopped", "start": 300.523, "end": 300.883}, {"text": "worrying", "start": 300.883, "end": 301.343}, {"text": "about", "start": 301.343, "end": 301.903}, {"text": "Tuesday.", "start": 301.903, "end": 302.323}]}, {"start": 303.257, "end": 311.366, "text": "On the wall in your kitchen, there's a frame. And inside it, a piece of paper. The ticket.", "words": [{"text": "On", "start": 303.257, "end": 303.417}, {"text": "the", "start": 303.417, "end": 303.577}, {"text": "wall", "start": 303.577, "end": 303.937}, {"text": "in", "start": 303.937, "end": 304.357}, {"text": "your", "start": 304.357, "end": 304.517}, {"text": "kitchen,", "start": 304.517, "end": 304.937}, {"text": "there's", "start": 305.417, "end": 305.737}, {"text": "a", "start": 305.737, "end": 305.797}, {"text": "frame.", "start": 305.797, "end": 306.157}, {"text": "And", "start": 306.917, "end": 307.157}, {"text": "inside", "start": 307.157, "end": 307.537}, {"text": "it,", "start": 307.537, "end": 307.797}, {"text": "a", "start": 308.197, "end": 308.297}, {"text": "piece", "start": 308.297, "end": 308.537}, {"text": "of", "start": 308.537, "end": 308.737}, {"text": "paper.", "start": 308.737, "end": 309.117}, {"text": "The", "start": 310.417, "end": 310.577}, {"text": "ticket.", "start": 310.577, "end": 310.977}]}, {"start": 311.816, "end": 315.85, "text": "It is worth nothing now. It was never the point.", "words": [{"text": "It", "start": 311.816, "end": 311.936}, {"text": "is", "start": 311.936, "end": 312.076}, {"text": "worth", "start": 312.076, "end": 312.376}, {"text": "nothing", "start": 312.376, "end": 312.916}, {"text": "now.", "start": 312.916, "end": 313.356}, {"text": "It", "start": 314.356, "end": 314.736}, {"text": "was", "start": 314.736, "end": 314.876}, {"text": "never", "start": 314.876, "end": 315.096}, {"text": "the", "start": 315.096, "end": 315.256}, {"text": "point.", "start": 315.256, "end": 315.576}]}, {"start": 316.3, "end": 323.397, "text": "The point was the thing it let you stop doing, which is wondering how you'll pay for everything.", "words": [{"text": "The", "start": 316.3, "end": 316.42}, {"text": "point", "start": 316.42, "end": 316.66}, {"text": "was", "start": 316.66, "end": 317.02}, {"text": "the", "start": 317.02, "end": 317.36}, {"text": "thing", "start": 317.36, "end": 317.62}, {"text": "it", "start": 317.62, "end": 317.76}, {"text": "let", "start": 317.76, "end": 317.96}, {"text": "you", "start": 317.96, "end": 318.18}, {"text": "stop", "start": 318.18, "end": 318.62}, {"text": "doing,", "start": 318.62, "end": 319.32}, {"text": "which", "start": 320.0, "end": 320.28}, {"text": "is", "start": 320.28, "end": 320.4}, {"text": "wondering", "start": 320.4, "end": 320.74}, {"text": "how", "start": 320.74, "end": 321.38}, {"text": "you'll", "start": 321.38, "end": 321.6}, {"text": "pay", "start": 321.6, "end": 321.98}, {"text": "for", "start": 321.98, "end": 322.26}, {"text": "everything.", "start": 322.26, "end": 322.58}]}, {"start": 323.847, "end": 334.192, "text": "The study didn't ask who was happiest. But the ones who didn't crash seem to have done one thing right. They kept their Tuesday.", "words": [{"text": "The", "start": 323.847, "end": 323.967}, {"text": "study", "start": 323.967, "end": 324.247}, {"text": "didn't", "start": 324.247, "end": 324.727}, {"text": "ask", "start": 324.727, "end": 325.027}, {"text": "who", "start": 325.027, "end": 325.467}, {"text": "was", "start": 325.467, "end": 325.767}, {"text": "happiest.", "start": 325.767, "end": 326.247}, {"text": "But", "start": 327.147, "end": 327.367}, {"text": "the", "start": 327.367, "end": 327.467}, {"text": "ones", "start": 327.467, "end": 327.707}, {"text": "who", "start": 327.707, "end": 327.927}, {"text": "didn't", "start": 327.927, "end": 328.347}, {"text": "crash", "start": 328.347, "end": 328.707}, {"text": "seem", "start": 328.707, "end": 329.487}, {"text": "to", "start": 329.487, "end": 329.667}, {"text": "have", "start": 329.667, "end": 329.767}, {"text": "done", "start": 329.767, "end": 329.967}, {"text": "one", "start": 329.967, "end": 330.267}, {"text": "thing", "start": 330.267, "end": 330.627}, {"text": "right.", "start": 330.627, "end": 330.987}, {"text": "They", "start": 331.907, "end": 332.087}, {"text": "kept", "start": 332.087, "end": 332.587}, {"text": "their", "start": 332.587, "end": 333.267}, {"text": "Tuesday.", "start": 333.267, "end": 333.667}]}, {"start": 334.642, "end": 342.906, "text": "Would you take the money, or keep your Tuesday? Tell us in the comments. And subscribe, because we've got more lives to try on.", "words": [{"text": "Would", "start": 334.642, "end": 334.822}, {"text": "you", "start": 334.822, "end": 335.062}, {"text": "take", "start": 335.062, "end": 335.362}, {"text": "the", "start": 335.362, "end": 335.502}, {"text": "money,", "start": 335.502, "end": 335.742}, {"text": "or", "start": 336.122, "end": 336.482}, {"text": "keep", "start": 336.482, "end": 336.742}, {"text": "your", "start": 336.742, "end": 336.962}, {"text": "Tuesday?", "start": 336.962, "end": 337.322}, {"text": "Tell", "start": 338.162, "end": 338.462}, {"text": "us", "start": 338.462, "end": 338.622}, {"text": "in", "start": 338.622, "end": 338.722}, {"text": "the", "start": 338.722, "end": 338.822}, {"text": "comments.", "start": 338.822, "end": 339.102}, {"text": "And", "start": 339.562, "end": 339.722}, {"text": "subscribe,", "start": 339.722, "end": 340.122}, {"text": "because", "start": 340.702, "end": 340.982}, {"text": "we've", "start": 340.982, "end": 341.222}, {"text": "got", "start": 341.222, "end": 341.362}, {"text": "more", "start": 341.362, "end": 341.702}, {"text": "lives", "start": 341.702, "end": 342.122}, {"text": "to", "start": 342.122, "end": 342.322}, {"text": "try", "start": 342.322, "end": 342.562}, {"text": "on.", "start": 342.562, "end": 342.762}]}]}